# The WebAssembly export surface.
#
# Kept separate from the core modules for the same reason pymodule_exports.elisa
# is: this file names a target-specific ABI. `export fn` gives each function
# external linkage so it survives -O2 (the backend prefers private linkage when
# optimising, which otherwise strips everything the shell wants to call).
#
# Built by scripts/build_wasm.sh; run by shells/web/elisa-wasm-runtime.js.

